  "note": "Re-judged 2026-10-31 by an independent auditor who authored none of faf7c5c380. RFC 2545 Section 3: \"A BGP speaker shall advertise to its peer in the Network Address of Next Hop field the global IPv6 address of the next hop, potentially followed by the link-local IPv6 address of the next hop.\" faf7c5c380 (filter chain model moved into internal/component/policy) changed one line in the tagged unit internal/component/bgp/reactor/rfc2545_forward_subnet_test.go::TestRFC2545EffectivePairPolicyAndMixedSibling: mustPolicy(t, []filterapi.FilterRef{{Name: \"ipv6:raw-next-hop\"}}, filterapi.FinalAccept) became mustPolicy(t, []routepolicy.Ref{{Name: \"ipv6:raw-next-hop\"}}, routepolicy.FinalAccept). mustPolicy still calls filterapi.NewPolicy with the same single unbound ref and the explicit accept final (NewPolicy now wraps policy.NewChain; an unbound ref stays external as the zero inProcess field did), so the policy the fixture installs, every input and every assertion are unchanged. No other commit touched the file since the verdict was stamped. faf7c5c380 (filter chain model moved into internal/component/policy) changed one line in the tagged unit internal/component/bgp/reactor/rfc2545_static_origination_test.go::TestStaticOriginateContinuesAfterUnusablePolicyNextHop: mustPolicy(t, []filterapi.FilterRef{{Name: \"static:replace-first-next-hop\"}}, filterapi.FinalAccept) became mustPolicy(t, []routepolicy.Ref{{Name: \"static:replace-first-next-hop\"}}, routepolicy.FinalAccept). mustPolicy still calls filterapi.NewPolicy with the same single unbound ref and the explicit accept final (NewPolicy now wraps policy.NewChain; an unbound ref stays external as the zero inProcess field did), so the policy the fixture installs, every input and every assertion are unchanged. No other commit touched the file since the verdict was stamped. Both units keep their assertions: the effective-pair unit still checks the effective next hop after export policy and the unchanged legacy sibling; the static unit still pins the exact static wire, the policy group order, the UPDATE/EOR counts, the recorded routes and the exact withdrawal wire. Every other tagged carrier is byte-identical and its judgement stands. Verdict unchanged: enforced. Ran: go test -tags ze_bgp -run over the six faf7c5c380-changed reactor units, PASS on 2026-10-31. Earlier judgements are in this file's git history.",
